{"title": "Duke Stelmane's Hand", "pageid": 18268, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Duke_Stelmane's_Hand", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png/300px-Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/8f/Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Duke Stelmane's Hand image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png/300px-Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Body_Part_Hand_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Duke Stelmane's Hand</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest\">quest</a> item.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The few remaining fingers on this hand have grown pallid, cold, and stiff.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Inside the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Bag\" title=\"Hand Bag\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Bag\" title=\"Hand Bag\">Hand Bag</a> carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/38px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/50px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dolor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">Dolor</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This hand was cut off of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Belynne_Stelmane\" title=\"Belynne Stelmane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png/25px-Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png/38px-Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png/50px-Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duke Stelmane's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png/25px-Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Portrait_Belynne_Stelmane.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Belynne_Stelmane\" title=\"Belynne Stelmane\">Duke Stelmane's</a> corpse by her murderer, Dolor.</li>\n<li>When used during the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a>, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emperor\" title=\"Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Emperor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emperor\">Emperor</a> reacts: <i>\"Can it be - Belynne herself, reduced to a spectre...\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201232\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18821/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5225/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 929716/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.627      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.627      1 -total\n 32.17%   13.391      7 Template:Icon_text\n 26.53%   11.045     21 Template:Trim\n 19.96%    8.310      4 Template:Icon_link\n